layer and more.\n\nversion - 0.6.5 - 24/04/26\nNew track, Rawal Karting.\nAudio fixes.\nAI driver variations, each AI driver drives with a different style.\nDynamic resolution\n\n\nversion - 0.6.3 - 12/04/26\n-AI opponents to race against,\n-Ghost replay, \n-New track \"Geneche\" featuring full day night cycle,\n-Gloves, Multi function display (MFD) on the steering wheel featuring race start, practice, ghost options, and telemetry, race order, and sound settings. \n-Improved graphics and performance optimisations, lap time display changes.\"", "short_description": "ibisim KART is a karting game which aims to bring a realistic driving experience to stand alone virtual reality headsets. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ibisim.co.uk/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "IBISIM", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ibisim.co.uk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35259469823668561"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312296_8330054433768618_2040169684064581446_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZHegSAxLwUoQ7kNvwGkiAgT&_nc_oc=Adrs2w11Bh5CQQc40NoOrUmppOepFDeGtPfVTkMN6kL4Vo6HElnUARXXsm73t6bxBtU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scon